        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Natural plant growth and development achieved in the IPK PhenoSphere by dynamic environment simulation</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: #fdf3f3;\n    font-family: \"Segoe UI\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .poster {\n    width: 1240px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: #fdf3f3;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Header ---------- */\n  header {\n    background: #8cb843;\n    padding: 18px 30px 22px 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  header .title {\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    max-width: 950px;\n  }\n  header .title .sub {\n    display: block;\n    font-size: 27px;\n  }\n  header .logo {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 30px;\n    top: 60px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n  }\n  header .logo .placeholder {\n    width: 70px;\n    height: 90px;\n    border: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.7);\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,.85);\n    font-size: 9px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n  header .logo .uni {\n    font-family: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif;\n    font-size: 19px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  /* ---------- Layout ---------- */\n  .content {\n    padding: 18px 45px 40px 45px;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 22px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .col { flex: 1; }\n  .card {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    padding: 22px 26px;\n  }\n  h2 {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: .3px;\n  }\n  .head-card { padding: 16px 26px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  p { font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 18px 0; }\n  p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #9aa;\n    background: #f4f4f4;\n    color: #667;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  /* Results left figure */\n  .fig1 {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 420px;\n    margin: 14px 0 22px 0;\n  }\n  /* Results right charts */\n  .fig2 {\n    width: 300px;\n    height: 210px;\n    float: right;\n    margin: 4px 0 8px 12px;\n  }\n  .fig3 {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 300px;\n    margin-top: 14px;\n  }\n  /* Contact bottom */\n  .contact-bottom {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n  }\n  .doodle {\n    flex: 1;\n    height: 110px;\n    margin-right: 14px;\n  }\n  .qr {\n    width: 150px;\n    height: 110px;\n    background: #d6e8a6;\n    border: none;\n    color: #37474f;\n    font-size: 21px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .watermark {\n    text-align: right;\n    color: #bdbdbd;\n    font-size: 22px;\n    padding: 6px 45px 14px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"poster\">\n\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"title\">\n      Natural plant growth and development achieved in the IPK\n      PhenoSphere by dynamic environment simulation\n      <span class=\"sub\">(作者个人信息区）</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"logo\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Logo: Eiffel tower line drawing]</div>\n      <div class=\"uni\">YuanBao<br>University<br>Zhumi</div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <!-- INTRODUCTION / METHODS -->\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"card head-card\"><h2>INTRODUCTION</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p>Plant phenotypes are influenced by the constraints and dynamics of their interacting environment. The PhenoSphere at IPK in Germany successfully simulates field-like conditions, allowing analysis of plant growth performance under diverse weather scenarios.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"card head-card\"><h2>METHODS</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p>Plant phenotypes are influenced by the constraints and dynamics of their interacting environment. The PhenoSphere at IPK in Germany successfully simulates field-like conditions, allowing analysis of plant growth performance under diverse weather scenarios.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RESULTS -->\n    <div class=\"card head-card\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\"><h2>RESULTS</h2></div>\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p>Fig. 1: The experimental sites at the IPK Gatersleben.</p>\n          <div class=\"placeholder fig1\">[Photo composite: four panels (a) PhenoSphere building exterior, (b) indoor compartment early growth, (c) indoor compartment late growth, (d) field 2016 — centered in left column]</div>\n          <p>a The PhenoSphere as seen from the outside. View into compartment 1 of the PhenoSphere early (b) and late (c) in the growth period. d The field 2016 at the IPK field site.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <div class=\"placeholder fig2\">[Chart: two stacked line plots — \"V – Stage\" (Mature leaves vs Days after sowing) and \"Leaf maturation\" (Leaves maturing / day); legend: field 2016, field 2017, field 2018, field 2019, glasshouse, PhenoSphere avg, PhenoSphere 2016 sim — top-right]</div>\n          <p>Fig. 2: Plant heights and growth speeds over time observed in seven field and indoor environments.</p>\n          <p style=\"clear:both;\">Fig. 3: Developmental stage progression and leaf maturation rates over time observed in seven field and indoor environments.</p>\n          <div class=\"placeholder fig3\">[Chart: 2×2 grid of line plots — \"V – Stage\" (Mature leaves), \"Plants with tassel (%)\", \"Leaf maturation\" (Leaves maturing / day), \"Tassel occurrence (% / day)\" vs Days after sowing (DAS); legend: field 2016, field 2017, field 2018, field 2019, glasshouse, PhenoSphere avg, PhenoSphere 2016 sim — bottom-right]</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- CONCLUSION / CONTACT -->\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"card head-card\"><h2>CONCLUSION</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p>The controlled environmental conditions are indeed spatially highly homogeneous across the cultivation areas of the PhenoSphere.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"col\">\n        <div class=\"card head-card\"><h2>CONTACT</h2></div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <p>Whatsapp：861356855××××<br>\n          Email： ××××0825@gmail.com</p>\n          <div class=\"contact-bottom\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder doodle\">[Illustration: line-art planets and cartoon planet faces with stars — bottom-left]</div>\n            <div class=\"placeholder qr\">Your<br>QR code</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">知乎 @ENGII 组委会官方…</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
